    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "87e9192c4c86ce8bdd182c08e61dc7edcb7137297a198ccbf88f31f3db13879c",
      "text": "In the morning, after breakfast, embark on a breathtaking flight over the Nazca Lines, the world-famous geoglyphs etched into the desert floor. From the air, you’ll have an unparalleled view of these mysterious shapes, including animals, plants, and geometric figures, that have puzzled archaeologists for centuries. The flight offers a unique perspective of these ancient symbols and is a must-do experience for anyone visiting Nazca.\n\nBus to Arequipa: After the flight, board a bus for a scenic journey to Arequipa, a beautiful colonial city known for its stunning architecture and surrounded by majestic mountains. The bus ride will take approximately 9 hours, so sit back and relax as you pass through diverse landscapes.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1IJ-ifZl_wfTwk-xMrqNJcO6OBMQunbcA",
